# ChatGPT-generated idea of a music program written in the language:
\ groove from bpm 100
    with bars 4
    with pattern [
        kick at [1, 3],
        snare at [2, 4],
        hats every 0.5
    ]
    render as midi

\ hats every spacing
    with hits from range 1 to bars * 4 by spacing
    return hats at hits

\ kick at beats
    return notes of "C1" at beats with velocity 100

\ snare at beats
    return notes of "D1" at beats with velocity 110

\ hats at beats
    return notes of "F#1" at beats with velocity 80

\ notes of pitch at beats with velocity
    return beats mapped to
        note with pitch
        starting at beat
        lasting 0.1
        with velocity

# More realistic implementation:
\a time := a positive fraction
	with
		Beats Per Bar := Numerator
		Beat Note := Denominator
	where
		Beat Note is a power of 2

\a beat (in 'Time or 4/4')? := a positive fraction where
	Denominator is a power of 2 and
	it < Beats Per Bar of Time

\hats every 'Interval, a beat in any T' in 'Time, a T' :=
	from Beat := 1 to < Beat Per Bar of Time + 1 by Interval,
		F#1 note at Beat

\kick at 'Beats' := D1 note at each of Beats

\snare at 'Beats' := C1 note at each of Beats

Song := at 100bpm, in 4/4 time, with 4 bar phrases,
	kick at 1 and 3
	snare at 2 and 4
	hats every 1/2

render Song as MIDI